<div>
<h3>Notifications</h3>
<p>Billing and account messages are always sent — they are about your account, not a promotion.</p>
<form>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<h4>Briefing</h4>
<p>What your workflows got done, at around 07:30 your time. Never sent when nothing ran.</p>
</div>
<div>
<button type="button" role="combobox" aria-controls="radix-_r_1_" aria-expanded="false" aria-autocomplete="none" dir="ltr" data-state="closed" aria-label="Briefing frequency" aria-describedby="_r_0_-form-item-description" id="briefing-frequency">
<span style="pointer-events: none;">
<div>
<span>Weekly</span>
</div>
</span>
