<div>
<h4>Alerts</h4>
<p>Only when something is waiting on you — never for a successful run. At most two a day.</p>
</div>
<button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="true" data-state="checked" value="on" aria-label="Alerts" id="_r_2_-form-item" aria-describedby="_r_2_-form-item-description" aria-invalid="false">
<span data-state="checked">
</span>
</button>
<input aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="checkbox" value="on" checked="" style="transform: translateX(-100%); position: absolute; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0; margin: 0px; width: 36px; height: 20px;">
</div>
<div>
<div>
<h4>Marketplace reviews</h4>
<p>When a workflow you submitted is approved or needs changes.</p>
</div>
<button type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" data-state="unchecked" value="on" aria-label="Marketplace reviews" id="_r_3_-form-item" aria-describedby="_r_3_-form-item-description" aria-invalid="false">
<span data-state="unchecked">
</span>
</button>
<input aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="checkbox" value="on" style="transform: translateX(-100%); position: absolute; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0; margin: 0px; width: 36px; height: 20px;">
</div>
